  "answer": "Here is a summary of the two emails:\n\n1. **Request for Property Development Video Marketing Series**: Emily Watson, CMO of Urban Renewal Properties, is contacting Casey to request a proposal for a video marketing series. The goal is to showcase innovative property development projects to attract investors and buyers, highlighting sustainability and modern design. The campaign aims to launch by the end of the next quarter.\n\n2. **RSVP Now: Final Reminder for the Annual Zenith Party!**: Stjepan Picek, COO of Zenith Corporation, is sending a final reminder for the Annual Zenith Party. The event will take place on Friday, October 25, from 6:00 PM to Midnight at the Rooftop Lounge, Zenith HQ. Team members are asked to reply with \"I’ll be there!\" by 5 PM the following day to help with seating and catering. The first 20 confirmations receive a VIP drink token."
